   "gap": 0.18
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "text": "Deep sea anglerfish. In some species, the male bites on, and never lets go.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler2.jpg",
    "z0": 1.16,
    "z1": 1.4,
    "cx": 0.48,
    "cy": 0.44
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "text": "Their tissue fuses. Their blood vessels join. They become one animal.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler2.jpg",
    "z0": 1.5,
    "z1": 1.24,
    "cx": 0.52,
    "cy": 0.46
   },
   "hero": {
    "at": 6,
    "lines": [
     "ONE",
     "BLOODSTREAM"
    ],
    "col": "a",
    "y": 380,
    "size": 124
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "text": "She can be sixty times his length.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler2.jpg",
    "z0": 1.28,
    "z1": 1.1,
    "cx": 0.42,
    "cy": 0.5
   },
   "hero": {
    "at": 3,
    "lines": [
     "60x LONGER"
    ],
    "col": "a2",
    "y": 390,
    "size": 150
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "text": "To survive being permanently grafted, he loses his immune system. The genes that would reject her, switch off.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler2.jpg",
    "z0": 1.12,
    "z1": 1.44,
    "cx": 0.55,
    "cy": 0.42
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "text": "They are the only vertebrates known to do it.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler2.jpg",
    "z0": 1.38,
    "z1": 1.14,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.48
   },
   "gap": 0.15
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "text": "And some of them do not swim. They walk.",
   "vis": {
    "t": "kb",
    "src": "angler1.jpg",
    "z0": 1.05,
    "z1": 1.32,
    "cx": 0.5,
    "cy": 0.55
